      "sourceTextSha256": "d5dbb100d61c5c3627ba3a464015d00a6e5665c7109e8a8628458fc3c3396850",
      "text": "Eight days from 30 December 2026 to 6 January 2027: celebrate New Year on Copacabana, visit Corcovado and Sugarloaf, then see Iguazu Falls from the Brazilian and Argentine sides. Four nights in Rio and three in Foz do Iguaçu; excursions with an English-speaking guide and transfers are provided on a group basis.",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada_en_973e64bf8d24",
        "model": "GPT-6",
        "wordAbsenceReason": "Word 2027 has no single lead combining these dates, overnight stays and group services; translated the RU summary, with the approved guide-language adaptation."
      }
    },
